{"id":"130100da-96c2-4bf3-80cc-fee18e24caa5","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:47:51.160Z","batchId":"settings_gpt-6-1-sol_low","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6.1-sol","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header>\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Account settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Manage your profile, choose what you hear from us, and control your privacy.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <div id=\"save-status\" class=\"alert\" role=\"status\" hidden></div>\n\n  <form id=\"settings-form\" class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"profile-heading\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"profile-heading\">Profile</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Your personal details and how you appear to others.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\" id=\"profile-avatar\" aria-label=\"Profile initials\">AC</div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"h4\">Profile photo</h3>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Your initials are shown when no photo is uploaded.</p>\n          <label class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" for=\"photo\">Upload photo</label>\n          <input id=\"photo\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp\" hidden>\n          <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"photo-help\">JPG, PNG or WebP. Maximum 5 MB.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n        <label class=\"label\">Full name\n          <input name=\"fullName\" id=\"full-name\" autocomplete=\"name\" value=\"Alex Chen\" required maxlength=\"80\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"label\">Email address\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" value=\"alex.chen@example.com\" required>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">Used for account updates and notifications.</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"label\">Display name\n          <input name=\"displayName\" value=\"Alex\" required maxlength=\"40\">\n          <span class=\"small muted\">The name shown on your public profile.</span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"label\">Time zone\n          <select name=\"timezone\">\n            <option value=\"America/Los_Angeles\">Pacific Time — Los Angeles</option>\n            <option value=\"America/New_York\">Eastern Time — New York</option>\n            <option value=\"Europe/London\">United Kingdom — London</option>\n            <option value=\"Europe/Paris\">Central European Time — Paris</option>\n            <option value=\"Asia/Tokyo\">Japan Standard Time — Tokyo</option>\n            <option value=\"UTC\">Coordinated Universal Time — UTC</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"label\">Bio\n        <textarea name=\"bio\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"240\" placeholder=\"Tell people a little about yourself.\"></textarea>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Optional. Up to 240 characters.</span>\n      </label>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"notifications-heading\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"notifications-heading\">Notifications</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose which optional updates arrive in your inbox.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"label check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"activity\" checked>\n        <span><strong>Activity updates</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Email me about replies, mentions and activity involving my account.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"label check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"productUpdates\" checked>\n        <span><strong>Product updates</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">New features, improvements and helpful tips.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"label check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"offers\">\n        <span><strong>Offers and announcements</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Occasional promotions and special offers.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"label\">Activity email frequency\n        <select name=\"frequency\" id=\"frequency\">\n          <option value=\"immediate\">As it happens</option>\n          <option value=\"daily\" selected>Daily digest</option>\n          <option value=\"weekly\">Weekly digest</option>\n        </select>\n        <span class=\"small muted\" id=\"frequency-help\">Applies to activity updates only.</span>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"alert small\">Essential security, sign-in and account service messages are always sent.</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-heading\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"privacy-heading\">Privacy</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Decide who can see your profile and how your data is used.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"label\">Profile visibility\n        <select name=\"visibility\">\n          <option value=\"private\" selected>Private — only you</option>\n          <option value=\"members\">Members — signed-in users</option>\n          <option value=\"public\">Public — anyone</option>\n        </select>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Controls access to your photo, display name and bio. Your email stays private.</span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"label check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"onlineStatus\">\n        <span><strong>Show online status</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Let people who can view your profile see when you are active.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"label check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"discoverable\">\n        <span><strong>Allow email discovery</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Let other members find your profile using your email address. Your email is not displayed.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"label check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"analytics\">\n        <span><strong>Share optional usage analytics</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Help improve the product by sharing how you use its features.</span></span>\n      </label>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"row between gap-lg\">\n      <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"change-state\">No unsaved changes.</p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"discard\" disabled>Discard changes</button>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\" id=\"save\" disabled>Save changes</button>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n    <p class=\"small muted\">Preview settings panel. Changes are saved only for this session, not to an account service.</p>\n  </form>\n</div>\n<style>\n#profile-avatar {width:64px;height:64px;flex-shrink:0;overflow:hidden}\n#profile-avatar img {width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}\n[hidden] {display:none!important}\n</style>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const form = document.getElementById('settings-form');\n  const status = document.getElementById('save-status');\n  const save = document.getElementById('save');\n  const discard = document.getElementById('discard');\n  const state = document.getElementById('change-state');\n  const avatar = document.getElementById('profile-avatar');\n  const photo = document.getElementById('photo');\n  let saved = capture(), savedPhoto = '', pendingPhoto = '';\n  function capture() {\n    return Array.from(form.elements).filter(e => e.name).map(e => [e.name, e.type === 'checkbox' ? e.checked : e.value]);\n  }\n  function initials() {\n    return document.getElementById('full-name').value.trim().split(/\\s+/).slice(0,2).map(s => s[0] || '').join('').toUpperCase() || '?';\n  }\n  function renderAvatar() {\n    avatar.replaceChildren();\n    if (pendingPhoto) {\n      const img = document.createElement('img');\n      img.src = pendingPhoto;\n      img.alt = 'Profile photo preview';\n      avatar.append(img);\n    } else avatar.textContent = initials();\n  }\n  function update() {\n    const dirty = JSON.stringify(capture()) !== JSON.stringify(saved) || pendingPhoto !== savedPhoto;\n    save.disabled = discard.disabled = !dirty;\n    state.textContent = dirty ? 'You have unsaved changes.' : 'No unsaved changes.';\n    const activity = form.elements.activity.checked;\n    document.getElementById('frequency').disabled = !activity;\n    document.getElementById('frequency-help').textContent = activity ? 'Applies to activity updates only.' : 'Enable activity updates to choose a frequency.';\n    renderAvatar();\n  }\n  form.addEventListener('input', () => { status.hidden = true; update(); });\n  form.addEventListener('change', update);\n  photo.addEventListener('change', () => {\n    const file = photo.files[0];\n    if (!file) return;\n    if (!['image/jpeg','image/png','image/webp'].includes(file.type) || file.size > 5 * 1024 * 1024) {\n      status.textContent = 'Choose a JPG, PNG or WebP image smaller than 5 MB.';\n      status.hidden = false;\n      photo.value = '';\n      return;\n    }\n    const reader = new FileReader();\n    reader.onload = () => { pendingPhoto = reader.result; update(); };\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file);\n  });\n  discard.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    saved.forEach(([name,value]) => {\n      const el = form.elements[name];\n      if (el.type === 'checkbox') el.checked = value;\n      else el.value = value;\n    });\n    pendingPhoto = savedPhoto;\n    photo.value = '';\n    status.hidden = true;\n    update();\n  });\n  form.addEventListener('submit', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    saved = capture();\n    savedPhoto = pendingPhoto;\n    update();\n    status.textContent = 'Settings saved for this preview session.';\n    status.hidden = false;\n  });\n  update();\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[8768,"<div"],[8770," class"],[8775,"=\""],[8775,"page"],[8776," stack"],[8777," gap"],[8878,"-lg"],[8879,"\">\n"],[8945," "],[8945," <"],[8945,"header"],[8945,">\n"],[9002,"   "],[9010," <"],[9015,"h"],[9020,"1"],[9024," class"],[9030,"=\""],[9034,"h"],[9037,"1"],[9042,"\">"],[9042,"Account"],[9043," settings"],[9044,"</"],[9044,"h"],[9045,"1"],[9045,">\n"],[9055,"   "],[9124," <"],[9130,"p"],[9137," class"],[9138,"=\""],[9138,"lead"],[9236," muted"],[9248,"\">"],[9254,"Manage"],[9258," your"],[9258," profile"],[9259,","],[9352," choose"],[9474," what"],[9599," you"],[9606," hear"],[9721," from"],[9730," us"],[9737,","],[9744," and"],[9750," control"],[9753," your"],[9759," privacy"],[9763,".</"],[9767,"p"],[9772,">\n"],[9773," "],[9773," </"],[9774,"header"],[9774,">\n\n"],[9775," "],[9775," <"],[9841,"div"],[9847," id"],[9858,"=\""],[9861,"save"],[9862,"-status"],[9863,"\""],[9864," class"],[9864,"=\""],[9950,"alert"],[9960,"\""],[9965," role"],[9969,"=\""],[9978,"status"],[9979,"\""],[9982," hidden"],[9985,"></"],[9991,"div"],[9994,">\n\n"],[9999," "],[10001," <"],[10002,"form"],[10002," id"],[10003,"=\""],[10004,"settings"],[10071,"-form"],[10075,"\""],[10082," class"],[10085,"=\""],[10087,"stack"],[10090," gap"],[10095,"-lg"],[10100,"\">\n"],[10103,"   "],[10106," <"],[10109,"section"],[10111," class"],[10111,"=\""],[10111,"card"],[10111," stack"],[10190," gap"],[10201,"-lg"],[10205,"\""],[10212," aria"],[10217,"-labelledby"],[10220,"=\""],[10224,"profile"],[10228,"-heading"],[10228,"\">\n"],[10229,"     "],[10230," <"],[10230,"div"],[10306,">\n"],[10308,"       "],[10318," <"],[10321,"h"],[10332,"2"],[10332," class"],[103